# Local Development Environment Variables for Cloudflare Worker
# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in your values
# .dev.vars is used by `wrangler dev` for local development
# DO NOT commit .dev.vars to git (it should be in .gitignore)

# Example environment variables (if needed for your worker)
# API_KEY=your-api-key-here
# SECRET_TOKEN=your-secret-token-here
